      "date": "2026-02-16T08:19:15.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹1.34 (vs ₹0.96 loss in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.34 (up from ₹0.96 loss in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹67.4m (down 31% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹14.5m (up ₹23.1m from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 22% (up from net loss in 3Q 2025). The move to profitability was driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 50% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 14% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
